#### How to Run

**Start the API server:**
```bash
uv run uvicorn web_api.main:app --reload --port 8099
```

**Start the frontend development server:**
```bash
cd web_ui
npm install
npm run dev
```

The frontend will proxy API requests to `http://localhost:8099`.

**Access:**
- API docs: http://localhost:8099/docs
- Frontend: http://localhost:5173

